special_abilities:
  - name: "Super Endurance"
    description: "Identical to the American Crazy: add 3D6x10 to S.D.C., 5D6 to Hit Points and +1D6 to P.E. Can lift and carry twice as much as a normal person of equivalent strength and endurance and lasts 10 times longer before feeling exhaustion. Can stay alert and fully efficient for up to three days (72 hours) without sleep, and needs only four hours of sleep a day."
  - name: "Increased Strength"
    description: "+2D4 to P.S. (minimum 19). P.S. counts as Augmented, the same as Headhunters, partial cyborgs and Juicers."
  - name: "Increased Speed"
    description: "+4D6 to Spd. As the American Crazy, can leap 20 feet (6 m) across and 15 feet (4.6 m) high after a short run, half that from a dead stop."
  - name: "Heightened Reflexes, Agility and Senses"
    description: "Training and M.O.M. augmentation give +4 to roll with punch, fall or impact, +2 on initiative and one extra attack per melee, and +1D6 to P.P. (minimum 17). Enhanced grace, silent move and balance add +12% to Climbing, Prowl and Acrobatics, in addition to O.C.C. bonuses (folded into the granted Climbing and Prowl; add it to Acrobatics if taken)."
  - name: "Enhanced Senses"
    description: "Enhanced vision, smell and touch equal to the American Crazy. Vision is a perfect 20/20 with hawk-like range: a small sign or a face can be read at up to two miles (3.2 km) with concentration and line of sight. Smell recognizes odors (01-65%), a person by scent (01-25%) and tracks by smell (01-30%) on a trail up to two hours old. Touch adds +10% to skills requiring a delicate touch, including all demolition skills, Pick Pockets, Pick Locks, Palming and Electronics (folded into the granted Pick Locks and Demolitions; add it to the others if taken). Enhanced hearing is not named on the Japan page; unless otherwise noted the powers are the American Crazy''s, whose hearing reaches a whisper at 300 feet (91.5 m) and gives an automatic dodge. +3 on Perception Rolls, as the stored American Crazy."
  - name: "Saving Throw Bonuses"
    description: "Same as the American Crazy: +2 vs psionics, +2 vs possession, +6 vs mind control, +4 vs toxins and poisons, +4 vs harmful drugs (in bonuses)."
  - name: "Enhanced Healing"
    description: "Same as the American Crazy: heals two times faster than normal and +15% to save vs coma and death. Virtually impervious to pain; physical pain does not impair the character until he is down to 10 Hit Points or less, when he suddenly feels his injuries."
  - name: "Crazies'' Bio-Regeneration"
    description: "Same as the American Crazy: in a helpless meditative trance the character restores 2D6 Hit Points and 3D6 S.D.C., stops bleeding and closes wounds in 2D4 minutes. An extended trance of six hours restores all S.D.C. and an additional 4D6 Hit Points."
  - name: "Major Psionics"
    description: "Six psionic powers from the Sensitive and Physical categories, from either or both, with no exceptions: twice the powers of an ordinary Crazy, and none of the American Crazy''s four excluded powers. The clans develop latent psychic talent in their candidates and use it for eavesdropping (astral travel, telepathic contact) and deceit (death trance, alter aura)."
  - name: "Delusions and Insanities (Controlled by Meditation)"
    description: "Suffers the same insanities as the American Crazy, rolled at the same levels (see level_progression). Meditation and therapy let the ninja crazy hold his insanities in check for 3D4 days at a stretch (the G.M. rolls in secret). At the end of that period he must save vs psychic attack/insanity once for EACH insanity or delusion he has, at +1 at levels 3, 5, 8 and 10 (cumulative, in bonuses) plus M.E. bonuses, and -1 cumulative for every day spent without returning to meditation and therapy. Meditation and therapy take over twelve hours a day and cannot be done on a mission. A failed save means that delusion has full force. Example: a 7th level ninja crazy saves at +2 and must make four rolls."
level_progression:
  - level: 2
    grants: ["Roll once on the Phobia Table"]
