restrictions:
  - "Cybernetics: starts with only one, a tracer chip the clan uses to keep tabs on the ninja. Additional implants must be purchased by the character."
  - "Hand to Hand: Ninjitsu is not available."
side_effects: "The M.O.M. implants cause escalating insanity, rolled at set levels as for the American Crazy, and the ninja crazy must keep them in check with meditation and therapy (see the Delusions and Insanities ability). The skull implants are easily visible and can be hidden only briefly under wigs, hoods, hats and helmets, so long-term undercover and infiltration work is impossible. A crazy whose sanity slips until he threatens the missions or the secrecy of the clans is eliminated on the jonin''s order. Money: 2D6x1000 credits plus 1D4x1000 credits'' worth of black market salable items; the clan may provide more for a mission and pays all living expenses."
